  Title: Feedback Gallery
  Try: 'Pick a tab, then a button: the feedback plays on the object in the middle.
    ''Compare'' plays every motion on the same cube; ''Presets'' plays the package''s
    default presets.'
  See: "Every feedback type of the package with the add menu's motion \u2014 the
    line at the bottom says what it does, its motion and its category (an item of
    category None plays in Before too). Short flashes are easier to see at a lower
    time scale. Hit Stop and Time Scale act on game time \u2014 watch the turning
    cube stop or slow down."
  Controls: "Mouse \u2014 tabs and buttons \xB7 Gamepad \u2014 D-pad and South"
